    a. Measurement resampling
    Model assumes uniformelz spaced slices that do not occur in practicle application, need to interpolate the cumulative measurements to
    estimate uniform samples

    b. Rotation and Summation matrices
    How to build a solvable system of equations with the information available

    Rotation matrix R: Maps the original voxel values into rotated grids

    Summation matrix S: Add the voxel values within horizontal slices

    B = S . R

    B is not (generally) square and invertible

